01:01:10,588 --> 01:01:16,588
Yes Man is a 2008 romantic comedy film directed by Peyton Reed, written by Nicholas
Stoller, Jarrad Paul and Christofer Tufton, and starring Jim Carrey.

11
01:07:17,647 --> 01:07:23,647
The film is based loosely on the 2005 memoir of the same name by the British
humorist Danny Wallace, who also makes a cameo appearance in the film.

12
01:13:24,705 --> 01:13:30,705
Production for the film began in Los Angeles in October 2007.

13
01:19:31,764 --> 01:19:37,764
It was released on December 19, 2008, in the United States and was then
released in the United Kingdom on December 26, 2008.

14
01:25:38,823 --> 01:25:44,823
The film received mixed reviews, with most critics calling the plot too similar to one of Carrey's
past films, Liar Liar, but was a box office success, making $223 million worldwide.

